        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek S80001, Stainless Steel Zeus 8 Inch Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Zeus 8 Inch Stainless Steel Pull  is easy to install on wood, metal, or fiberglass doors and comes packaged with all the hardware needed to thru-bolt it on a door up to 1-3/4 inches thick. This Stainless Steel Zeus 8 Inch Door Handle has a brushed stainless steel finish and looks great in any contemporary space. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-zeus-back-to-back-8-inch-pull-set-pair-emtek-btb-s80001\"><b>Stainless Steel Zeus Pull with Back-to-Back Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Stainless Steel Zeus Solid Brass Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 1\" x 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 1-3/4\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with (2) 1\" long 1/4\"-20 screws, (2) 1\" long #10-32 screws, (2) 2\" #10-32 screws, and (2) screw caps.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually with thru-bolt mounting.</i>\r\n</p>",
